/* Türkçe for the web editor and the TiviBro phone app (the TV app has its own, app/js/lang).  The English text
   is the key (I18n, app/js/i18n.js); {n} a number, {x} {y} {z} any text; a list is the plural forms of {n}: [one, other].
   Plain JSON inside I18n.add (double quotes, no comments, no trailing comma): the phone app reads it as JSON.
   node scripts/i18n-companion.js tr lists what is still in English. */
